  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1: The AddHealthChecks() prerequisite is now documented. RehydrationService takes a HealthCheckService, so without it the host fails to start, and without a primary-tagged check rehydration silently never runs. The README's eight documentation links pointed at .md files that are not part of the package and were dead for every consumer; it now links the published site. The InstanceName examples no longer show a doubled colon. The registration failure semantics are documented accurately: a disabled core cache registers nothing and does not throw. Logging uses LoggerMessage delegates. XML documentation is now shipped. No public API was removed or renamed; the shipped XML documentation is the user-facing addition, which is why this is a minor release.",
